    "name": "SlotSync API",
    "description": "Complete SlotSync API collection covering authentication (with refresh-token rotation), admin, counsellor, student, waitlist, analytics and audit endpoints — including failure cases (401 / 403 / 409 / 422).\n\n**Token auto-save:** Register/Login/Refresh requests store tokens into environment variables automatically via test scripts.",
